; GaiaLabs Retranslation, chapter 21. Dialogue only.

?INCLUDE 'st68_neil'
st68_neil.dialogstring_06AB53! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Five days passed since we[N]entered the undersea[N]tunnel.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]The scenery looks the same[N]no matter how much you[N]walk. We began to feel[N]overwhelmed…[FIN][CLD][PAU:28][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: How about we rest[N]here for today?[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm exhaaausted. I[N]think we walked about a[N]thousand kilometres today.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Don't be stupid.[N]Human legs can't walk that[N]far.[FIN][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Geez, I can't stand[N]it…![FIN]This journey's been[N]nothing but one exhausting[N]event after another…[FIN][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Everybody's[N]thinking the same thing,[N]so be quiet…![FIN]More importantly, let's[N]eat. I'm hungry.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_erik'
st68_erik.dialogstring_06AE70! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: I'm peeing, so don't[N]come look![END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_lance'
st68_lance.dialogstring_06AF03! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: How the heck long[N]does this tunnel go on[AD]?[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_neil'
st68_neil.dialogstring_06ACB9! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: People must have[N]walked this tunnel[N]thousands of years ago.[WAI][N]It's strange. Knowing they[N]stood where we stand makes[N]them feel less distant.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_lily'
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B57D! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Humans are[N]mysterious, aren't we…?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,5][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]When you're pushed to the[N]absolute limit, you might[N]know with a glance if[N]something is edible or if[N]it's poisonous.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]I wonder if it was that[N]was for the people of the[N]past.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_kara'
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B069! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Aah, I want to eat[N]a steak…! I want to eat a[N]salad…!![FIN]My skin is already turning[N]dry because we're only[N]eating weird things…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_mushrooms'
st68_mushrooms.dialogstring_06B86E! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]We found these mushrooms[N]living in this tunnel when[N]we arrived.[FIN]They're our only source of[N]food.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Yesterday was fried[N]mushrooms. The day before[N]yesterday was boiled[N]mushrooms.[FIN]When we ate them raw three[N]days ago and they were[N]frightfully disgusting…[FIN]But we can't concern[N]ourselves with luxuries[N]like flavour.[FIN]We're being patient in[N]order to live, but when it[N]comes to having an empty[N]stomach…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_kara'
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B0BC! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Oh gosh. Will found[N]mushrooms again…[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You have to think[N]of it as being better than[N]starving to death.[N]Alright, let's eat…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_erik'
st68_erik.dialogstring_06AE88! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Like this, one day again[N]passed slowly…[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_lily'
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B606! `[DEF]The sixth day in the[N]tunnel.[FIN][DEF]Unable to sleep, Will[N]watched the underground[N]stream in the darkness.[END]`
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B661! `[BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Can't sleep?[END]`
st68_lily.dialogstring_06B67B! `[PAU:1E][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: Yeah. I'm hungry.[N][PAU:28][AD]I'm kidding.[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: You know, Will,[N]we've all changed since we[N]left home.[WAI][N]Maybe journeys make people[N]grow whether they mean to[N]or not.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@CastleV051Will]Will: My change is a[N]little more literal.[N]You've seen me become[N]that warrior.[WAI][N]I think something happened[N]to me at the Tower of[N]Babel. I think the comet[N]may be part of it.[WAI][N]Sometimes, as Freedan,[N]I remember things that[N]never happened to me.[WAI][N]Battles. Faces. Places[N]I've never seen.[WAI][N]When I change back, it[N]fades, like waking from[N]someone else's dream.[WAI][N]Sometimes I worry that if[N]I stay as Freedan for too[N]long... that I might lose[N][PAU:18]myself.[WAI][N]I don't understand[N]why. But I think this[N]journey is leading me[N]to the answer.[WAI][N]What about you, Lilly?[N]Why did you come this far?[FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: I told myself[N]we were discovering[N]history... maybe even[N]making it.[WAI][N]I think that after being[N]saved by Lance... and you,[N]enough times...[WAI][N]I think somewhere we[N]became family, and not[N]just friends. I even think[N]of Kara as a sister now.[WAI][N]But don't you DARE[N]tell her that![WAI][N]We have another long day[N]tomorrow. I'm going to[N]sleep.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_neil'
st68_neil.dialogstring_06AD22! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme0]Two weeks since entering[N]the undersea tunnel. We[N]still can't see an exit…[END]`
st68_neil.dialogstring_06AD64! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Hey hey. Were there[N]eerie sounds coming from[N]above the tunnel when we[N]were sleeping last night?[FIN][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: I think ya often[N]notice those sort o'[N]sounds… That ain't it; ya[N]were just gettin' tired.[END]`

?INCLUDE 'st68_kara'
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B10B! `[BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Listen… You can[N]hear it even now…! I[N]wonder what it is… That[N]sound…[END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B13C! `[CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: Is the tunnel caving[N]in?![FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: This is bad[AD]!![N]Run!![FIN][CLD][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,3][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2]Lilly: Run where!? We're[N]in a tunnel![END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B195! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: Everyone, quiet![N]Listen to that repeating[N]vibration.[WAI][N]It's Morse code.[WAI][N]Ships use short and long[N]signals to represent[N]words.[WAI][N]I think I can decode it.[N]Give me a moment.[END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B250! `[BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,1][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5][DLY:4]I'm Seth…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4][DLY:4][DLY:0]Lance: Did ya say it's[N]Seth?![FIN][BOR:6][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme2][DLY:0][DLY:0]Lilly: Shh… Be quiet…[N][PAU:3C][DLY:0]Neil's about to continue.[FIN][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,2][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5][DLY:0][DLY:4]I was swallowed by a[N]Leviathan…[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme5][DLY:4]And then, when I regained[N]consciousness, my body had[N]been transformed into the[N]form of a Leviathan.[FIN]These life forms that we[N]call Leviathans may be[N]understood as humans that[N]live in the sea.[FIN]From what my fellow[N]Leviathans say, the light[N]of the comet distorts the[N]evolution of living things[N]or something like that.[FIN]I'd join you on your[N]journey again, but my[N]body's like this, so…[FIN]Please stay strong anyway,[N]and bring the mysteries of[N]the comet and the ruins to[N]light…[END]`
st68_kara.dialogstring_06B3EC! `[CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: The signal stopped.[FIN][CLD][BOR:7][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme1]Kara: Poor Seth[AD][FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme4]Lance: Seth learned Morse[N]code too, huh? Guess all[N]those books paid off.[FIN][CLD][BOR:3][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme3]Erik: But he's not even[N]human anymore![FIN][CLD][BOR:D][DLG:3,4][SIZ:D,4][PRT:@RetranslationTheme6]Neil: I wouldn't say that.[N]We call the human body[N]the best one because it[N]is the body we know.[WAI][N]If Seth can think, choose,[N]and care about us, maybe[N]his shape isn't the part[N]that matters most.[WAI][N]Come on. We still have a[N]long road ahead.[END]`
